subckt dut (VDD GND VSS Vinp Vinn Voutp)
C1 (Voutp net2) capacitor c=1p
I1 (net0 GND) isource dc=1m
M1 (net3 Vinp net1 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net2 Vinn net1 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (net1 net0 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (net0 net0 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M5 (Voutp net0 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M6 (net3 net3 GND VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M7 (net2 net3 GND VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M8 (Voutp net2 GND VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
